# The `large` workload block corpus (issue #2104): where
# scripts/bench/fetch_corpus.sh downloads it from, and the sha256 of its
# MANIFEST.sha256 (which pins every file of the corpus). The generator is
# deterministic, so a local
#   python3 scripts/bench/corpus/generate.py --preset large --out DIR
# with generator v1 against go-algorand v5.0.4-stable reproduces this pin.
# Publishing the asset is a manual maintainer step: see "Workload corpus" in
# docs/BENCHMARK_COMPARISON.md.
